# Normalise on commit, check out native. Authored on Windows, built on macOS.
* text=auto

# These are executed, not read. CRLF makes them fail on macOS and Linux with an
# opaque "bad interpreter" error, so pin them regardless of platform.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Swift and shader sources: keep LF everywhere so xcodebuild and swiftc see the
# same bytes CI does.
*.swift text eol=lf
*.metal text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf

*.yml text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Site models are binary if they ever get committed deliberately.
*.usdz binary
*.reality binary
*.ply binary
